We have one DPS5350S, which I believe is the 3rd party version of RZ74, in
which case the only difference is that the firmware is more generic. The
number of blocks in /sys/data/cam_data.c matches exactly, which seems to
confirm this. We also have two DPS5400S on the same system. I don't know what
they are called in the DEC world, but they are both 4.0 GB in size. All of
these works OK. RZ74 is in cam_data.c in OSF/1 v2.0B (Rev. 250.113), so it's
definitely supported in that version. I had to add entries for DPS5400S, but
the differences to the RZ74 entry were minor.

