From what you say, there doesn't seem to have been any event that happened that could have caused this.  Please send me (djp@unx.dec.com) the output from
"ls -l /usr/.smdb./OSF*".

|>The copy was done in single user as well.... (From boot, not by shutdown,
|>so there should have been no problems there....
