I followed a documentation the reference to I found in this
newsgroup (sorry, I lost the reference, but maybe we are talking
of the same document). This worked perfect on 1.3, for 2.0 we had to
fix some additional problems with programs/scripts on /usr
that were requested before the /usr-mount during startup:

