You had to uncompress the tar archive first before extracting:

   > cp OSFBASE200 /tmp/OSFBASE200.Z
   > umcompress /tmp/OSFBASE200.Z
   > tar xvf /tmp/OSFBASE200 ./usr/bin/passwd

