Sorry, I misunderstood the original request.  However, it looks like you still
won't have to access the subset directly.  The reason is that /usr/bin/passwd is
a hard link to /usr/bin/chfn.  Assuming you still have chfn around, just create
the link to it.

If you do want to access the subset anyway, do the following (assuming the DEC
OSF/1 CDROM is mounted on /mnt):

cd / 
uncompress < /mnt/ALPHA/BASE/OSFBASE200 | tar xpf - ./usr/bin/passwd


Dave


